pan></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb B\\in M\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B^2\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\subseteq\\mathbb B^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b317b32e88081cdf\" href=\"?note=b317b32e88081cdf\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}generic\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\langle\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\rangle\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B)\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\left(D\\subseteq\\mathbb B^+\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb B^+,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\upharpoonright\\mathbb B^+)\\to U\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}generic\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3GenericUltrafilter}_S(M,\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\langle\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\rangle\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B})\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\mathbb B)\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\left(D\\subseteq\\mathbb B^+\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb B^+,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\upharpoonright\\mathbb B^+)\\to U\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Genericity meets every dense subset of the positive Boolean algebra using the restricted Boolean order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"b317b32e88081cdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt"